    native ProgressView (web Spinner). Compiled against the REAL apps/apple component closure (Tokens +
    TSDesign + TSMaterial + Typography + Cards + Buttons + Badges + Metrics; none import Shared) in the
    iOS+macOS typechecks below. Recharts -> none / Leaflet -> none.
  States (all render) -> loading · data · empty(friendly italic) · error(+retry) · stale(chip overlay on
